### Highest confidence (primary source, verified live)
W3C WebAuthn issue #1658 / PR #1957 and the reviewer objection · Microsoft Entra device-bound vs synced gating · NCC Group Keybase audit scope and findings · Keybase reset semantics and `oconnor663`'s history-transfer statement · keybase.io still live, keybase.pub dead 2023-03-01 · Element's recovery-key help text · 322 Matrix UTD issues via `gh` · Ink & Switch Keyhive quotations · UCAN v1.0.0 key-mobility language · Apple sponsor/applicant/voucher and the 10-attempt HSM destruction · eIDAS letter: **552 signatories, 42 countries, 26 Nov 2023** · EUDI GitHub issue #10: 3,042 reactions, 179 comments · Estonia ROCA dates, 750,000 cards, €2.2M · Pew smartphone-only table · ITU 2024 figures · RFC 8628 §5.4 · Storm-2372 dates and mechanism · PubMed zero-result term checks · Matthews CHI 2016 abstract · Freed CHI 2018 (89 participants) · Bellini CHI 2023 (158+16).

### Medium confidence
Sovrin dissolution date and read-only MainNet (two sources, one secondary) · Sovrin's economic causal narrative · Nostr and AT Protocol total-loss behaviour (shape verified, incident history not) · Cisco AIR per-capita figures · London phone-theft figures · Freifunk and NYC Mesh figures via Wikipedia · Decidim Barcelona participation numbers.

### Low confidence — do not lean on these
The Keybase Bitcoin→Stellar Merkle-root migration (one HN comment) · "~10% of Matrix users see a daily UTD" (one HN comment, not telemetry) · FDO's low adoption (suspected, **unverified**) · Fission's fate (DNS non-resolution is circumstantial, not proof) · the Wikipedia 11–18 month replacement cycle (uncited, contradicts industry figures).

### Verified negative results — absences, not search failures
- **No published figure anywhere for Keybase paper-key retention.**
- **No published Matrix device-verification completion rate; zero academic papers on Matrix cross-signing UX in OpenAlex or Crossref.**
- **No vendor publishes end-to-end recovery-success telemetry for any system in this report.**
- **No measured operational-friction data for the X-Road two-region federation** — the one clean no-common-root federation, and the literature is silent, confirmed across two independent passes.
- **PubMed: zero results for "human-device dyad" and "person-device dyad."**
- **No literature on person↔device relation formation for screenless devices** (§7.3).
- **Nobody has deployed identity-as-a-person-device-dyad at community scale — or at any scale.** The nearest system to deploy the adjacent idea (Sovrin, pairwise relational identity) is dissolved and read-only as of May 2025.

### NOT REACHED — plausible-to-exist, unverified, closable with a working search engine
GSMA Mobile Gender Gap phone-*sharing* rates · Deloitte per-household device counts · smartphone replacement-cycle data · Google's 2019 account-hygiene percentages · Google/Microsoft device-loss lockout rates · numeric findings inside the Cornell CETA, Daffalla 2023/2025 and Bicakci 2025 papers · Khera/Drèze primary sources and Jharkhand numbers · Guifi.net "Compact for a Free, Open and Neutral Network" text and critiques · Sardex quantitative outcomes · Decidim's census-verification mechanism · Swedish BankID elderly-fraud statistics · MitID 2021–22 migration complaints · EUDI Large-Scale Pilot findings (POTENTIAL/NOBID/DC4EU/EWC — project sites 404/DNS-failed) · Pan-Canadian Trust Framework · ICAO PKD CSCA structure and gaps · Matter commissioning failure rates and DAC/PAA hierarchy · FIDO Device Onboard adoption · caBLE technical detail and deployment · Apple Shared iPad mechanism · ChromeOS/Windows kiosk identity · Mark Miller's *Robust Composition* (erights.org unreachable) · Phil Windley's "relationships not identities" · Daniel Hardman's peer-DID writing · did:webs · Bluesky migration docs and did:plc incident history · SSB's decline timeline and stated reasons · Nostr nsec-leak incident data · Signal PNI primary source · ACM DL and IEEE Xplore full text throughout.

